---

## Quick Start

### 1. Run Baseline Analysis

```bash
cd /home/ubuntu/ubp_fertilizer_chemical_study
python3 scripts/analyze_ballance_products.py
```

This analyzes current Ballance products and generates `outputs/ballance_products.json`.

### 2. Design Optimized Formulations

```bash
python3 scripts/design_optimized_formulations.py
```

This creates three optimized formulations and generates `outputs/optimized_formulations.json`.

### 3. Generate Figures

```bash
python3 scripts/generate_paper_figures.py
```

This creates publication-quality plots in the `docs/` directory.

### 4. Read the Paper

Open `docs/UBP_Fertilizer_Study.md` to read the complete research paper with all findings and recommendations.

